OL,3,ARussell Brand found guilty of rape and
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has been convicted of
OL,7,Frape and sexual assault, and is now
OL,8,Fexpected to face a substantial prison
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FA jury found the entertainer guilty of
OL,12,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,13,Fsexual assault, following a four-week
OL,14,Ftrial at Southwark Crown Court in
OL,15,FLondon.
OL,17,FHe was found not guilty of two other
OL,18,Fcounts of rape, and one count of
OL,19,Fattempted indecent assault. The jury
OL,20,Fdeliberated for eight-and-a-half hours.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
