OL,3,AWho could be behind hoax bomb threats
OL,4,Ato European air travel?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is hardly surprising that the
OL,7,Fsimultaneous, co-ordinated nature of
OL,8,Fthese airline hoaxes, coupled with
OL,9,Fother malicious actions across Europe,
OL,10,Fare causing some people to point the
OL,11,Ffinger of suspicion at Russia.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
