OL,3,AWhat can Democrats do with control of
OL,4,ACongress? We answer your US midterms
OL,5,Aquestions
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, final races are still to be
OL,8,Fcalled - in Alaska, Republican Dan
OL,9,FSullivan trails Democrat Mary Peltola
OL,10,Fby a razor-thin margin
OL,12,FDonald Trump has weighed in on the race
OL,13,Fthere, attacking "Fake Dan Sullivan" -
OL,14,Fan independent candidate who has the
OL,15,Fsame name as the Republican hopeful
OL,17,FElsewhere, Democrat Hakeem Jeffries -
OL,18,Flikely to be the next Speaker of the
OL,19,FHouse - says Congress will rein in "an
OL,20,Fout-of-control" Trump administration
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
